
flowchart TD
    A([User Request]) --> B[Coordinator Agent]
    B --> C[Research Agent]
    C --> D[Analyzer Agent]
    D --> E[Critic Agent]

    E --> F{Approved?}

    F -->|Yes| G[Writer Agent]
    G --> H([Final Answer])

    F -->|No, retry available| D
    F -->|No, retry limit reached| I([Stop])

    D -->|Empty Analysis| I

    style A fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    style H fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    style I fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
